{"html":"<p>Sign-up, search, checkout: forms are where users give your app data. In React, you usually keep each field&#39;s value in state, so the screen always shows exactly what your code knows. Then validation and submitting are just JavaScript.</p>\n<h2 id=\"controlled-inputs\">Controlled Inputs</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> NameField</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setName</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> htmlFor</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Name&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">label</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"name\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">        onChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> setName</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(event.target.value)</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">{</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">name </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">||</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"stranger\"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">!&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The input is <strong>controlled</strong>: React state is the single source of truth. <code>value</code> shows the state, and every keystroke calls <code>onChange</code>, which updates the state, which re-renders the input. That loop lets you transform input (uppercase, limit length) or react to it on every keystroke.</p>\n<p>Pass <code>value</code> together with <code>onChange</code>. A <code>value</code> without <code>onChange</code> makes a read-only field, and React warns about it.</p>\n<h2 id=\"submitting\">Submitting</h2>\n<p>Handle the form&#39;s <code>onSubmit</code>, not the button&#39;s click, so pressing Enter works too:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  event.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// no page reload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  onSignup</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(email);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">form</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  …&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Sign up&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">button</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">form</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>;</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"checkboxes-and-selects\">Checkboxes and Selects</h2>\n<p>A checkbox uses <code>checked</code> instead of <code>value</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">newsletter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setNewsletter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"checkbox\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">  checked</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">newsletter</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">  onChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> setNewsletter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(event.target.checked)</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">/>;</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>A select works like a text input:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">select</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">plan</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> setPlan</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(event.target.value)</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Free&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pro\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Pro&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">option</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">select</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"many-fields-one-state-object\">Many Fields, One State Object</h2>\n<p>For larger forms, keep the values in one object, and use each input&#39;s <code>name</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">form</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setForm</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ email: </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, password: </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, plan: </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> handleChange</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">event</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> event.target;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  setForm</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">...</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">form, [name]: value });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">form.email</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">handleChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">input</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">form.password</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> onChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">={</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">handleChange</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> /></span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>[name]: value</code> sets the property whose name is in <code>name</code>, and the spread keeps the others.</p>\n<h2 id=\"validation\">Validation</h2>\n<p>Compute errors from the current values, instead of storing them separately, and show them only once the user has had a chance to type:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> SignupForm</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">onSignup</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">email</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setEmail</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">touched</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setTouched</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">email.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">includes</span><span style=\"